  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models with pca_n2000 RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_006) achieve 0.635 accuracy at 7.02 GPU hours, while config_001 (same RNA but resnet50 image) has slightly higher accuracy (0.639) at higher cost. This experiment tests transformer aggregation and concat fusion (vs avgpool+weighted in previous configs), which could improve performance. It uses the same image encoder as config_006 but with more complex aggregation/fusion, offering a promising balance between exploration and cost (estimated ~8-9 GPU hours)."
}

